{
  "chapter_id": "CH015",
  "title": "Grace Barely Touched",
  "sections": [
    {
      "section_id": "SEC059",
      "title": "More Than We Have Used",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "There is a word spoken over this church that we have not yet begun to exploit the grace that has been given to us. The church has fought in the mercy of God, and mercy is the power of God, but what God is waiting for from us is to receive His inheritance, which is grace. We have not understood grace. We have still much to learn, and we must come back to it again and again.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA231",
            "IDEA232",
            "SRC006309",
            "SRC006310",
            "SRC006311",
            "SRC006385",
            "SRC006386",
            "SRC006312",
            "SRC006315"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC006309",
            "SRC006310",
            "SRC006311",
            "SRC006385",
            "SRC006386",
            "SRC006312",
            "SRC006315"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA231",
            "IDEA232"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000001",
          "provider_handle": "p1"
        },
        {
          "text": "You remember that in John chapter 1 it says that the law came by Moses, but grace and truth came by Jesus. He came with grace and truth — grace in any way you can imagine it. And the word truth means manifestation, or reality. Truth is the manifestation of grace, its reality. That is why the word became flesh.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA233",
            "IDEA234",
            "REF045",
            "SRC006324",
            "SRC006325",
            "SRC006326",
            "SRC006328",
            "SRC006329",
            "SRC006331",
            "SRC006332",
            "SRC006339"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC006324",
            "SRC006325",
            "SRC006326",
            "SRC006328",
            "SRC006329",
            "SRC006331",
            "SRC006332",
            "SRC006339"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA233",
            "IDEA234"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [
            "REF045"
          ],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000002",
          "provider_handle": "p2"
        },
        {
          "text": "You did not see anything when you came here. You did not see anything. Moses did not see God either. What Moses had was temporal, brother — temporal. He did not see the face of God. He was only in the presence. That is why you will see him later, in Exodus chapter 33.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA235",
            "REF046",
            "SRC006344",
            "SRC006351",
            "SRC006355",
            "SRC006369",
            "SRC006373",
            "SRC006377",
            "SRC006379",
            "SRC006356"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC006344",
            "SRC006351",
            "SRC006355",
            "SRC006369",
            "SRC006373",
            "SRC006377",
            "SRC006379",
            "SRC006356"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA235"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [
            "REF046"
          ],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000003",
          "provider_handle": "p3"
        },
        {
          "text": "And God is living — He is living inside of you. What Moses only approached from outside, in a passing presence he could not fully see, now lives within.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA236",
            "SRC006381",
            "SRC006383"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC006381",
            "SRC006383"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA236"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000004",
          "provider_handle": "p4"
        }
      ],
      "idea_refs": [
        "IDEA231",
        "IDEA232",
        "IDEA233",
        "IDEA234",
        "IDEA235",
        "IDEA236"
      ],
      "source_refs": [
        "SRC006309",
        "SRC006310",
        "SRC006311",
        "SRC006385",
        "SRC006386",
        "SRC006312",
        "SRC006315",
