        "SRC006383"
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "SEC060",
      "title": "What Changed in Them",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "The grace already described found its echo in what people themselves began to say about what shifted in them.",
          "kind": "connective",
          "evidence_handles": [],
          "source_refs": [],
          "idea_refs": [],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000005",
          "provider_handle": "p5"
        },
        {
          "text": "One said: I used to focus on blessings for other people, for certain situations, without myself focusing on God or the realization of my own blessings. I often asked myself why, when others pray, it works, but when I pray, it doesn't. This program is for me an answer to communion with the Holy Spirit.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA227",
            "SRC006236",
            "SRC006237",
            "SRC006238"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC006236",
            "SRC006237",
            "SRC006238"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA227"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000006",
          "provider_handle": "p6"
        },
        {
          "text": "Another said: I learned here that Jesus is a light. He is this light that lives in me, and I am this temple. That brings me to understand the orientation I should take in my prayers and in the spiritual answers. This is the message I am receiving, what the Holy Spirit is giving me in broad terms through this program.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA228",
            "SRC006239",
            "SRC006240",
            "SRC006241"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC006239",
            "SRC006240",
            "SRC006241"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA228"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000007",
          "provider_handle": "p7"
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesterday, one said, you revolutionized my way of worshiping the Lord, my way of seeing God. I wanted to go on staying in that atmosphere — it was as if I were no longer in my own living room. I kept on, holding onto what had been said, that when our soul loves the Lord completely, it is possible to worship God even without speaking, to worship God even while asleep, even while working.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA229",
            "SRC006260",
            "SRC006271",
            "SRC006275",
            "SRC006282",
            "SRC006285",
            "SRC006286"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC006260",
            "SRC006271",
            "SRC006275",
            "SRC006282",
            "SRC006285",
            "SRC006286"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA229"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000008",
          "provider_handle": "p8"
        },
        {
          "text": "And when I looked at myself the next morning, I noticed that I was not tired. When you really pray, when you are really in the presence of God, you do not get tired — you renew your strength.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA230",
            "SRC006288",
            "SRC006290",
            "SRC006291",
            "SRC006292"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC006288",
            "SRC006290",
            "SRC006291",
            "SRC006292"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA230"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000009",
          "provider_handle": "p9"
        }
      ],
      "idea_refs": [
        "IDEA227",
        "IDEA228",
        "IDEA229",
        "IDEA230"
      ],
      "source_refs": [
        "SRC006236",
        "SRC006237",
        "SRC006238",
        "SRC006239",
        "SRC006240",
        "SRC006241",
        "SRC006260",
        "SRC006271",
        "SRC006275",
        "SRC006282",
        "SRC006285",
        "SRC006286",
        "SRC006288",
        "SRC006290",
        "SRC006291",
        "SRC006292"
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "SEC061",
      "title": "Healing Already Accomplished",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "Isaiah chapter 53 verse 5 says that by His stripes we are healed. I'm going to start from health: all that we need has already been healed. The word is already established in heaven — it is not something we are waiting to receive, but something already accomplished that we only need to declare and believe.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA243",
            "REF049",
            "SRC006701",
            "SRC006706",
            "SRC006710",
            "SRC006715",
            "SRC006723"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC006701",
            "SRC006706",
            "SRC006710",
            "SRC006715",
            "SRC006723"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA243"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [
            "REF049"
          ],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000010",
          "provider_handle": "p10"
        },
        {
          "text": "On a series I had entitled a certain way, I did not want to go back to it, and I did not have the desire to repeat it. But then insistence came for me to return to that same text, and then I began — and I saw what I had not seen in it before.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA244",
            "EX039",
            "SRC006744",
            "SRC006763",
            "SRC006775",
            "SRC006782",
            "SRC006799",
            "SRC006804"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC006744",
            "SRC006763",
            "SRC006775",
            "SRC006782",
            "SRC006799",
            "SRC006804",
            "SRC006826",
            "SRC006834",
            "SRC006835"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA244"
          ],
          "example_refs": [
            "EX039"
          ],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [
            "UNC030"
          ],
          "paragraph_id": "P000011",
          "provider_handle": "p11"
        },
        {
          "text": "Understanding scripture is dimensional, it is progressive. Coming back to the same text later can reveal depths that were not seen the first time.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA244",
            "SRC006826",
            "SRC006834",
            "SRC006835"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC006826",
            "SRC006834",
            "SRC006835"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA244"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000012",
          "provider_handle": "p12"
        }
      ],
      "idea_refs": [
        "IDEA243",
        "IDEA244"
      ],
      "source_refs": [
        "SRC006701",
        "SRC006706",
        "SRC006710",
        "SRC006715",
        "SRC006723",
        "SRC006744",
        "SRC006763",
        "SRC006775",
        "SRC006782",
        "SRC006799",
        "SRC006804",
        "SRC006826",
        "SRC006834",
        "SRC006835"
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "SEC062",
      "title": "The Sower in One Man",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "This same pattern of growing understanding appears again in the way one person can pass through every stage of the sower's parable.",
          "kind": "connective",
          "evidence_handles": [],
          "source_refs": [],
          "idea_refs": [],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000013",
          "provider_handle": "p13"
        },
        {
          "text": "The Lord showed that the parable of the sower can be read not only as different people but as different stages within a single person's growth. I practically saw this happen: a man who came to church repeatedly moved through those very stages.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA246",
            "EX041",
            "SRC006917",
            "SRC006920",
            "SRC006931",
            "SRC006933",
            "SRC006936"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC006917",
            "SRC006920",
            "SRC006931",
            "SRC006933",
            "SRC006936",
            "SRC006961",
            "SRC006971",
            "SRC006990",
            "SRC006952",
            "SRC006988"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA246"
          ],
          "example_refs": [
            "EX041"
          ],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000014",
          "provider_handle": "p14"
        },
        {
          "text": "At first the word fell by the wayside in him — the man did not understand. But he came back to the church. At that stage he was rocky ground; he had no soil, he had no soil. And this time, a little soil was there. But the man came back again, and he bore thirty-fold fruit.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA247",
            "EX041",
            "SRC006944",
            "SRC006952",
            "SRC006957",
            "SRC006961",
            "SRC006964",
            "SRC006970",
            "SRC006971",
            "SRC006988",
            "SRC006990"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC006944",
            "SRC006952",
            "SRC006957",
            "SRC006961",
            "SRC006964",
            "SRC006970",
            "SRC006971",
            "SRC006988",
            "SRC006990",
            "SRC006933"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA247"
          ],
          "example_refs": [
            "EX041"
          ],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000015",
          "provider_handle": "p15"
        },
        {
          "text": "I am just going back to what was said, going back to what he said. If he has to repeat himself, you keep doing that. That is the task of the good shepherd — to keep sowing the seed patiently, even through repetition, even when no fruit is yet visible.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA248",
            "SRC007007",
            "SRC007009",
            "SRC007018",
            "SRC007020"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC007007",
            "SRC007009",
            "SRC007018",
            "SRC007020"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA248"
          ],
          "example_refs": [],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000016",
          "provider_handle": "p16"
        },
        {
          "text": "I saw children playing — dirty clothes and all. I asked one, how are you called? And I said, enter Bible college. That boy, Remy, is the man who is now a machine in prayer. Millions of people follow him — I think the last count is about six million people who follow him.",
          "kind": "substantive",
          "evidence_handles": [
            "IDEA249",
            "EX042",
            "SRC007029",
            "SRC007034",
            "SRC007036",
            "SRC007069",
            "SRC007076",
            "SRC007077",
            "SRC007034"
          ],
          "source_refs": [
            "SRC007029",
            "SRC007034",
            "SRC007036",
            "SRC007069",
            "SRC007076",
            "SRC007077"
          ],
          "idea_refs": [
            "IDEA249"
          ],
          "example_refs": [
            "EX042"
          ],
          "reference_refs": [],
          "uncertainty_refs": [],
          "paragraph_id": "P000017",
          "provider_handle": "p17"
        }
      ],
